    "text": "By Terry Shropshire ,\n1 hours ago Brandon “Scoop B” Robinson has spent much of his life proving that the best stories in sports extend far beyond the scoreboard. From NBA locker rooms and celebrity basketball games to conversations with some of the most recognizable names in entertainment, Scoop B has carved out a distinctive lane in sports journalism — one built on relationships, persistence and an instinct for understanding where sports and popular culture intersect. Read full article",
